{
    "//": [
        "The image's Look-and-Feel package — plan/17. It carries the splash, because that is",
        "the unit Plasma's splash is packaged in: ksplashqml resolves a Plasma/LookAndFeel",
        "package id and loads contents/splash/Splash.qml out of it (splashwindow.cpp,",
        "SplashWindow::setGeometry).",
        "",
        "THE ID IS THE SELECTION. /etc/xdg/kdeglobals names this package as the session's",
        "LookAndFeelPackage, and startplasma turns that id into ~/.config/kdedefaults/ksplashrc",
        "on first login — see ../kdeglobals.in. /etc/xdg/ksplashrc names the same id for the",
        "reads that never reach a session. Stage 40 asserts all three spellings agree.",
        "",
        "There is ONE package per image, not one per purpose. On the installer medium stage 40",
        "adds contents/layouts/org.kde.plasma.desktop-layout.js to this same package for the",
        "live session's task-manager pins (plan/16); on the product that directory is absent and",
        "the layout resolves to Breeze's. The two used to be separate packages, and the medium",
        "then had a LookAndFeelPackage with no splash in it, which is precisely how it booted to",
        "Breeze while every config file in the image said otherwise.",
        "",
        "Everything this package does not ship still resolves to Breeze: plasma-workspace makes",
        "org.kde.breeze.desktop the FALLBACK package for any id but its own, so colours, style,",
        "icons, cursors, lock screen and logout are untouched. Note that this holds for the",
        "contents/defaults FILE as well — shipping one here would replace Breeze's wholesale",
        "rather than override a key in it, which is why there isn't one."
    ],
    "KPackageStructure": "Plasma/LookAndFeel",
    "KPlugin": {
        "Id": "@DISTRO_ID@",
        "Name": "@DISTRO_NAME@",
        "Description": "The @DISTRO_NAME@ splash screen",
        "Category": "",
        "License": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
        "Authors": [
            {
                "Name": "@DISTRO_NAME@"
            }
        ],
        "Website": "@HOME_URL@"
    },
    "X-Plasma-APIVersion": "2"
}
